== Lindenmayer Systems <sec:algos_l_system>

Also known as L-systems, they are a formal grammar and rewriting system, 
with good examples in @compelling_procedural_3d_env_landscapes.

These can be grown over multiple steps like @SC, 
but may require significantly more effort to miniaturize 
due to the recursive nature of the algorithm.
Adding @LOD essentially requires dedicated production rules that 
cause splits into defined levels, making authorship difficult. 
